WEBVTT

00:04:27.952 --> 00:04:31.136
from over 100 businesses,
schools and cities

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:34.560
to adopt 100 percent renewable energy.

00:04:34.584 --> 00:04:36.188
Tim Guinee: My name's Tim Guinee.

00:04:36.212 --> 00:04:39.196
I'm a proud member
of the Climate Reality Project.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:42.444
On September 10, 2001,

00:04:42.468 --> 00:04:46.123
that night I went on a ride-along
with my friend Captain Paddy Brown,

00:04:46.147 --> 00:04:48.186
who was the most decorated firefighter

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:50.676
in the history of
New York City firefighting,

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:53.524
and the incredible crew of Truck 3.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.536
And around 6:30, 7
in the morning, I went home,

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.746
and a little while later,

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:04.529
they got the call and responded
to the World Trade Center.